# JobPilot AI — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in values from the Supabase dashboard
(Project Settings → API).

```bash
cp .env.example .env.local
```

## Required for Supabase client (Phase 2+)

```
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
```

Leave blank during the current UI/architecture phase. The app runs on the
local data service layer until these are set.

Never commit real keys. `.env` and `.env.local` are gitignored.
